    <item>
      <title>Michael Goin：vLLM“铁王座”背后的静默架构师——从DeepSeek到多模态，铸就AI推理新标准</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/michael-goinvllmdeepseekai-20251216071002230-0/</link>
